  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremia na okobwatana kw’ogotianania",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana rikarua ase Omonene rigacha ase ’nde inche Yeremia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "riganteebia: “Igwa amang’ana ’okobwatana kw’ogotianania, kwana n’Abayuda na abanto bamenyete Yerusalemu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obateebie: Aya nar’Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Aragererigwe omonto otari koigwera amang’ana ’okobwatana oko",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nachigete chisokoro chiaino, ekero nachirusetie korwa ase ense ya Misiri, ense eria yarenge buna eriko rigosamba. Nigo nabateebeetie ng’a kobaranyigwere na bakore onsi aya nabachigete, erio nario baare gocha koba abanto baane, na inche imbe Nyasae obo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase enchera eyio nigo nare konyara goikerania eira y’ogotiana narierete chisokoro chiabo ng’a nimbae ense entenenku ere namabeere na amooke, buna akoregete goika rituko ria reero.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inche Yeremia nkairaneria, nkabora, “Ee, Omonene, tiga abe bo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri’Omonene aganteebia, “Genda ase emechie y’Abayuda na ase chinchera chia Yerusalemu, orarie amang’ana aya onsi, oteebie abanto bategerere amang’ana ’okobwatana okwo na koyakora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero narusetie chisokoro chiaino korwa ase ense ya Misiri, nigo nachikurerete mono ng’a chinyigwere, nonya ngoika rituko ria reero ningendererete gochikurera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende tichianyigwerete gose gontegerera. Kera omonto nigo akong’etie enkoro yaye, akagenderera gokora ebibe. Nigo nachichigeete chibwate okobwatana koria, korende chikaanga. Ase ayio nkabaikeraneria amang’ana onsi ay’okobwatana koria.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Omonene aganteebia, Abayuda na abanto ba Yerusalemu bakorire omooroberio bw’ogokora mamincha yane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwo baonchokire bairaneire ebibe bie chisokoro chiabo, chiria chiangete koigwera amang’ana aane. Bairaneire gosasiima chinyasae ching’ao na gochikorera. Ee, Abaisraeli amo n’Abayuda basaririe okobwatana kw’ogotianania nakorete ne chisokoro chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engencho eyio inche Omonene nkobarentera inde ogosiria, na barabwo tibakonyara gwetooria, na ekero baraarere ase ’nde, tinkobaigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Engaki eria abanto bare ase emechie y’Abayuda, na aba Yerusalemu nabasambere chinyasae echio ubani na korera ase chirochio ng’a chibakonye, korende tichikonyara kobatooria ekero ogosirigwa korabacheere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe abanto ba Yuda, chinyasae chiaino nigo chire chinyinge buna emechie yaino ere emenge, na buna chinchera chia Yerusalemu chire chinyinge, naboigo nebisasimero bi’obosooku bire, biria mwaroiseretie Baali, enyasae eria mogosambera ubani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, aye tobaisa gosabera abanto aba, gose korera ase ’nde ase engencho ya barabwo, ekiagera inche tinkobaigwa ekero barandangerie ase engencho y’emechando yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto aba nyanchete bakorire okogechia. Inki rende bagokora ase enyomba yane? Inee! Chiira bakoria, na ebing’wanso bakorua, nabinyare koonchora ogosirigwa kwabo gokobacheera? Ekero mwakorire ebibe, nario mokogoka?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo kare inche Omonene nigo nabaarogete “Omozeituni omobese obwate amazeituni amaya”, korende bono narentire okogukura okonene na koyotongia omorero, ne chinsagia chiaye chiyie chisareke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inche Omonene bw’Emeganda nabasimegete, korende bono nachiikire amabe abachere, ekiagera inwe Abaisraeli na Abayuda mwangechirie namabe aino ay’ogosamba ubani ase Baali nkaba nendamwamu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omoroberio bw’ogoita Yeremia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akamanyia igoro y’ebibe ebio, nainche nkabimanya; nere akanyorokia aya barenge gokora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende inche nkaba buna emanwa y’eng’ondi enyororo ekoirwa konyenywa. Tinamanyete ng’a nigo baroberetie amabe ase ’nde. Bagakwana iga; “Tiga tosirie omote oyo amo namatunda aye. Tiga toyobutore orue ase ense y’abanto bare moyo, erinde erieta riaye risire kegima tiriinyorwa nonya ng’ake.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Omonene bw’Emeganda okonacha ebiina ase oboronge; aye okoriga‐rigia ebirengererio bi’enkoro, tiga ndore gokorusia egesiomba ase bare, ekiagera nabekire amang’ana aane asore.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, aya nar’Omonene agoteeba igoro y’abanto b’Anatoti, abwo bakorigia kong’ita, bagoteeba ng’a timbaisa kobana ase erieta ri’Omonene, bateba ng’a inse gokora igo nigo barang’ite.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, aya nar’Omonene bw’Emeganda agoteeba: “Nimbae egesusuro; abamura babo nabaitwe ase esegi, na abana babo, abamura na abaiseke, nabakwe nenchara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gose monto onde obo nonya noyomo tagotigara ore moyo, ekiagera ase omwaka bw’egesusuro kiabo nindetere abanto b’Anatoti amabe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
